# enchant weapon's new affects, saved. Smokegod (60) enchants a sword (3021, no bonuses of its own) and saves, and his
# player file shows each affect's where. The damroll bonus was made TO_OBJECT, but the hitroll one was left at
# new_affect's 0, TO_AFFECTS (#58). Now both are TO_OBJECT.
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
set skill smokegod all 100
set char smokegod mana 30000
@obj 3021 3001
get sword
cast 'enchant weapon' sword
@pulse 24
save
@file ../player/Smokegod
